<title>germany: Merck 1996 net profit rises.</title>
<headline>Merck 1996 net profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>DARMSTADT 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Calendar 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group net profit			   502     vs 368</p>
<p>    Group cash flow			    914     vs 773</p>
<p>    Group sales				  6,953   vs 6,269</p>
<p>    Dividend				     1.25 marks</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German drugs group is Merck KGaA. The company paid a dividend of 0.32 marks for the final quarter of 1995, equivalent to a full-year dividend of 1.28 marks. The company also said that it had a pleasing start in 1997 and that in the first two months of 1997, group sales rose 15.9 percent</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
